  "description": "10 years as a shepherd, 10 years on the battlefield, and 10 years as a heinous killer. Ricky began as a shepherd of the Hyden Plains, then became swordmaster, and lastly met his end as the death-bringing Steel Assassin. He met his lonely end in a plain after living a life filled with the stench and screams of fire, steel, blood, and death, only to reincarnate as the third son of a noble in a world 100 years after the war ended. Was there value in the past war that made him an assassin? Ricky begins his new life as an adventurer in an academy and seeks to find the meaning of life and war...\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
